{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "separator",
	"title": "Separator 分隔线",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "在视觉或语义上分隔内容。",
	"dependencies": [
		"@ui-sdk/core@0.1.0-beta.17",
		"@ui-sdk/svelte@0.1.0-beta.17",
		"svelte-toolbelt@0.10.6"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"分隔线",
				"separator",
				"divider",
				"分割线"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"分隔内容组或菜单项",
				"orientation=vertical 纵向分隔"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "对话中带文字的分隔，如日期",
					"use": "marker"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"纯装饰时设 decorative，读屏忽略"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"纵向分隔线在父元素中自动拉伸高度"
			],
			"related": [
				"marker",
				"card",
				"item"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Separator 设计规范\n\n- 方向用 `orientation`（默认横向）；竖向分隔需要父元素有高度或在 flex 行中使用。\n- 只起视觉分隔作用时设 `decorative`，读屏器会忽略它；分隔两段有意义的内容时保持默认。\n- 默认粗细 0.5 px。设置卡片行间线浅色用黑色 8.8%，深色用白色 8.3%，随卡片表面合成。卡片有 16 px 行内留白时，行间线可以和内容对齐。\n- 用同一粗细与颜色分隔竖向内容。需要局部主题色时，在容器上设置 `--valar-separator`。带文字的分隔在对话中用 `<Marker.Root variant=\"separator\">`。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "separator/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Root from \"./separator.svelte\";\n\nexport {\n\tRoot,\n\t//\n\tRoot as Separator,\n};\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "separator/index.ts"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { Separator as SdkSeparator, type SeparatorOrientation } from \"@ui-sdk/svelte/separator\";\n\timport { styleToString } from \"svelte-toolbelt\";\n\timport { createAttachmentKey } from \"svelte/attachments\";\n\timport { cn } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { Snippet } from \"svelte\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\t\"data-slot\": dataSlot = \"separator\",\n\t\torientation = \"horizontal\",\n\t\tdecorative = false,\n\t\tchild,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\tstyle,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: Omit<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>, \"style\"> & {\n\t\tref?: HTMLElement | null;\n\t\tchild?: Snippet<[{ props: Record<string, unknown> }]>;\n\t\tstyle?: HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>[\"style\"] | Parameters<typeof styleToString>[0];\n\t\torientation?: SeparatorOrientation;\n\t\tdecorative?: boolean;\n\t\t\"data-slot\"?: string;\n\t} = $props();\n\n\tconst refKey = createAttachmentKey();\n\tconst attachRef = (element: HTMLElement) => {\n\t\tref = element;\n\t\treturn () => {\n\t\t\tif (ref === element) ref = null;\n\t\t};\n\t};\n</script>\n\n<SdkSeparator\n\t{orientation}\n\t{decorative}\n\taria-hidden={decorative || undefined}\n\tdata-horizontal={orientation === \"horizontal\" ? \"\" : undefined}\n\tdata-vertical={orientation === \"vertical\" ? \"\" : undefined}\n\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\"shrink-0 bg-[color:var(--valar-separator,var(--valar-separator-base,lch(0%_0_0_/_8.8%)))] dark:[--valar-separator-base:lch(100%_0_0_/_8.3%)] data-horizontal:h-[0.5px] data-horizontal:w-full data-vertical:w-[0.5px] data-vertical:self-stretch\",\n\t\t\"\",\n\t\tclassName\n\t)}\n\tstyle={style && typeof style === \"object\" ? styleToString(style) : style}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{#snippet render({ props })}\n\t\t{#if child}\n\t\t\t{@render child({ props: { ...props, \"data-slot\": dataSlot, [refKey]: attachRef } })}\n\t\t{:else}\n\t\t\t<div {...props} data-slot={dataSlot} {@attach attachRef}>{@render children?.()}</div>\n\t\t{/if}\n\t{/snippet}\n</SdkSeparator>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "separator/separator.svelte"
		}
	]
}